'''Nazousagi''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]] and can be unlocked during the [[Nazousagi Collaboration Event]] by completing questions contained in the manga, then patting the Cat on the Cat Base menu during the collab's period.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 321
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nazousagi
|name2 = Miya Ōdō Rabbit
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Miya Ōdō Rabbit''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] make this unit entirely irrelevant. Therefore, this Cat is only useful for increasing your [[User Rank]], as its stats aren't viable for anything more than that.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Midranger}}

